WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
The request contract defines the oracle.

00:00:02.224 --> 00:00:06.880
This example transfers ten thousand
Canadian cents with a stable idempotency

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.200
key. Repeating the same key and payload
must return the original transfer.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:15.600
Changing the payload under that
key must produce a conflict.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.600
The expected journal has one
transaction and two balanced entries,

00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:22.320
with the agreed payer
and recipient balances.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.400
Key scope,

00:00:24.448 --> 00:00:28.320
retention and recovery rules need
explicit agreement with the service owner.
